[{"title":"南康元宵偶成","author":"王济元","text":"山国逢元夜，寒斋席尚冰。\n雪深仍问雨，俗俭不知灯。\n强酒欣同醉，题诗病未能。\n一檠聊照寂，乡思陡然兴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52690,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西梁大风","author":"王济元","text":"晓发秦淮棹，西风此再游。\n春惊沙岸柳，梦落野田鸥。\n采石风翻雨，梁山浪没舟。\n江神莫相戏，久矣任沈浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52691,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早发虞山别诸亲友兼示儿子","author":"王济元","text":"片帆千里破霜行，亲旧分携怅别情。\n共以岁寒疑远道，俱将春暖订归盟。\n梅开江上三冬白，雁度虞山一画青。\n孺子不须啼满颊，归依灯火听鸡声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52692,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二月二十八日喜晴","author":"王济元","text":"深院忽闻莺语滑，小窗轻递暖风来。\n桃花自悔知春早，输却荼蘼自在开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52693,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉挽复庵侍赠君一律","author":"王济元","text":"霜风吹雁暮云横，雕落俄惊失典型。\n市义一生田叔仿，论交千古宴平情。\n烂柯亭畔馀棋局，采石江头坠酒星。\n惭愧未能酬国士，只依残月吊空青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52694,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题思亭","author":"王济元","text":"自承遗训莫窥园，云满地亭草满轩。\n啮指音容还冉冉，伤心风木故翻翻。\n呼天欲报难为德，阙地何由可徼原。\n遗泪只今挥令伯，每聆乌鸟一番喧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52695,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕有感","author":"李全昌","text":"过去方来瞬息中，浮生大半掷虚空。\n每怜墙壁孤灯伴，肯信庚申上帝通。\n根器不分禅俗侣，盘餐常夹笋蔬供。\n来朝再整俳场套，只恐优旃伎俩穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52696,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见复弟阳羡归，送茶、兰、壶、脯四物，却纪","author":"李全昌","text":"征途引盼政无聊，阳羡春深损惠饶。\n省舌馥凭兰蕊合，鹿膘浓藉茗壶消。\n半旬不及临觞叙，众美何当远市邀。\n悦口娱心种种备，卷南真自愧山樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52697,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦","author":"李全昌","text":"岁岁正逢只此身，漫教随俗步馀尘。\n聚来熟面希生侣，弹得新冠总旧人。\n古貌不工优孟态，狂心且醉伯伦春。\n安贫便是长生诀，何用浮言赋大椿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52698,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次近复兄送伯发侄南征三首 其一","author":"李全昌","text":"才堪压众定争先，甲榜悬知映卯躔。\n正巧寓中力贯札，复申剥后总邀天。\n共看云梦长吞腹，好拉姮娥笑拍肩。\n门阀自今勤再整，从来接翼比联蝉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52699,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次近复兄送伯发侄南征三首 其二","author":"李全昌","text":"多士逢年作者先，即看奎柄岂离躔。\n文凭时命原无价，福喜栽培赖有天。\n鲲举北溟方奋翮，鹿鸣南国未驰肩。\n明春何处羁金勒，御苑啼莺柳噪蝉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52700,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次近复兄送伯发侄南征三首 其三","author":"李全昌","text":"高著凭君肯让先，行旌南指卜星躔。\n三年磨砺功由己，八月泥金信自天。\n文贵碧鸡堪刮目，岁逢玉兔好仔肩。\n衣裳试整新罗绮，释褐从教似蜕蝉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52701,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋雨中赴酌见复弟有感","author":"李全昌","text":"尽日先愁风雨催，可堪良夜付徘徊。\n逢时但饮酉堂酒，遣兴频呼左相杯。\n望里姮娥空有约，撤来屏障竟无媒。\n平分秋色凭谁判，但对华筵剪烛灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52702,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日喜晴","author":"李全昌","text":"名利从前总一无，却看多少换蘼芜。\n身栖盘谷应携杖，门设柴关懒贴符。\n纵许蔽裘逢岁涤，休教本脸上场糊。\n爆声只羡邻童闹，那得同将老景扶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52703,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戊辰上元苦雨。承见复弟惠历兼招灯坐赋谢","author":"李全昌","text":"春宵觅酒政无门，赐历还呼饮柏樽。\n烂目尽教灯代月，轩眉偏喜岁逢元。\n筵开玳瑁流杯换，歌踏毡毹舞袖喧。\n何幸穷途当圣世，从君行乐共吹埙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52704,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"李全昌","text":"吾老何辞惫，游闲白日宜。\n全身非马足，裹肉是鸡皮。\n笔为钞书秃，窗缘看竹移。\n偶然闻剥啄，顿起鹿门期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52705,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春杪思茶","author":"李全昌","text":"日倒时家新样壶，策勋全在润脾枯。\n如何消渴成都者，不设茶床只酒垆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52706,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁乙巳过造适园，修整思亭有感","author":"李鹏翀","text":"偶阅台池旧，俄成岵屺哀。\n遗踪无可问，手植宛新栽。\n亭小存堂构，园荒半草莱。\n伤心聊补葺，洒泪湿泉台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52707,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送振涵兄赴己酉乡试","author":"李鹏翀","text":"夙羡淩云笔，相看献赋场。\n凤毛宜彩耀，骏骨合名扬。\n高堂今始报，薄俗亦增光。\n伫撷秋香满，临歧举一觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52708,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己酉秋夕，有怀王实所，与时炅儿同留南雍","author":"李鹏翀","text":"兀坐新秋思不禁，客无同调夜阴阴。\n此行恨不偕余往，今夕还多忆子心。\n天涯明月遥相对，眼底秋花不共簪。\n欲慰远怀无别望，南楼早晚听鸿音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52709,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己酉孟秋二十六日，余方昼寝，忽苍头传邻人徐敬滨速售西基，余以素手辞。而又遣子促赴勉就成事，从兄少参喜祖业得还，奖以诗，次韵志感","author":"李鹏翀","text":"午馀卧起睡初醒，惮暑科头谢送迎。\n忽报西邻售旧业，勉从东乞赴新盟。\n忆昔全基称壮丽，视今存室尽颓倾。\n满怀往事抛流水，一任旁人更品评。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52710,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙辰仲春升儿释褐寄题志喜","author":"李鹏翀","text":"礼经传祖业，再试逐时髦。\n旅聚须安俗，身单自惜劳。\n朱衣天有定，宝鉴物无逃。\n安得科名永，孙枝似汝曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52711,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙丑小春，伯兄出咏菊诗五首命和，时兄迁居南庄，偕坐别去，口占二首 其一","author":"李鹏翀","text":"弟兄双鬓渐如霜，惆怅天南各一堂。\n共席恰还欣对菊，分飞空复想寻芳。\n丛枝带月疑无色，细蕊经寒尚有香。\n何似棣棠花靴匕，徘徊今夕岂能忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52712,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙丑小春，伯兄出咏菊诗五首命和，时兄迁居南庄，偕坐别去，口占二首 其二","author":"李鹏翀","text":"旧业新营仅免霜，何如别墅敞华堂。\n频年闹里身同寄，此日闲中色转芳。\n最喜轩轩尘不染，更看习习座生香。\n从来挟得贤中馈，作客离家亦自忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52713,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题唐仲言可赋亭","author":"李奕茂","text":"家庭夜静霜月高，孤城系析哀鸿号。\n长歌凄断白石裂，北风卷褐如锥刀。\n我生濩落困蓬荜，饭牛蹑屩宁辞劳。\n眼中年少尽得意，尘埃龌龊非吾曹。\n鸣呼人生各有适，山林何处无由巢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52714,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次叔父思亭原韵","author":"李奕茂","text":"每从月朔涉芳园，雨露凄其对此轩。\n鸟绕深枝啼不定，梦依修竹泪偏翻。\n居遥曾莫馀三里，音隔那当是九原。\n共被贻谋犹未振，门庭偏愧雀罗喧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52715,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登啸歌阁步叔父原韵","author":"李奕茂","text":"四壁新题信穆如，凭高俯仰适鸢鱼。\n荷风暗递香生室，梧月光临水浸居。\n曲曲回栏工点缀，沈沈迂径且潇疏。\n若非胸臆藏丘壑，安得层层任展舒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52716,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承沈禹图别驾招饮凭虚阁，即席次韵","author":"李奕茂","text":"邂逅相携历旧游，倾怀一笑石城头。\n快题白雪悲今古，回首朱颜感去留。\n屐为屡登几敝齿，剑因久佩只馀缑。\n醉来倦倚凭虚阁，满眼山烟碧玉浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52717,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"虚窗独步为昌仲叔赋","author":"李奕茂","text":"觑破浮名不可凭，眼前何事足垂膺。\n兴来欲寄瓢为斝，老去无烦枝倩藤。\n盈几诗书堪尚友，偶群虚浪岂良朋。\n悠然独对闲中趣，日隐蓬窗懒逐蝇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52718,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯下对紫薇","author":"李奕茂","text":"高卧空山百感生，一番风雨倍伤情。\n孤灯寂寂谁相问，只有薇花照眼明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52719,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得月楼十六夜看月","author":"李奕茂","text":"此夜清光好，中秋昨已过。\n阴晴疑未卜，圆缺问如何？\n抱病难胜酒，伤怀且放歌。\n凭高迟赏玩，凉影入来多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52720,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馀杭道中","author":"徐时进","text":"风雨馀杭道，崎岖事远征。\n树穿山罅绿，麦缀陇头青。\n马首望还望，羊肠行复行。\n仆夫忽攀柳，为报已清明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52721,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望君山二首 其一","author":"徐时进","text":"春风犹记舞衣斑，暂借图书白昼闲。\n最是酒醒人静后，梦魂无夜不君山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52722,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望君山二首 其二","author":"徐时进","text":"杜鹃何处血流殷，细逐溪声断续间。\n双袖数行游子泪，好凭流水到君山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52723,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和西吾师山居 其一 结庵","author":"徐时进","text":"结屋藏空谷，翛然隔世嚣。\n半龛留月住，四壁倚云牢。\n泉绕铛边净，山围枕畔高。\n有人时问偈，一任叩扉劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52724,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和西吾师山居 其二 编篱","author":"徐时进","text":"石径盘回尽，参差见竹篱。\n短惟堪限足，高亦正当眉。\n野蝶飞无碍，遥山坐可窥。\n幽芳谁更好，丛菊晚开时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52725,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠含珠","author":"徐时进","text":"银箭铜壶夜未央，薰风初入合欢床。\n怪来枕畔攲明月，自是君身有夜光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52726,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邓凤扇","author":"徐时进","text":"寂寞文园病渴馀，寻春偶入绛仙居。\n西湖十里莲如锦，试比卿妆总不如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52727,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画梅","author":"徐晞","text":"一棵老梅树，两个大桠叉。\n未结黄金果，先开白玉花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52728,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仲秋下浣同周砚农过漱石轩看叶梅廊留饮即事","author":"张拙","text":"幽赏无如酒共诗，朋欢相对复何之。\n双螯正美兼鲈脍，晚桂生香先菊卮。\n述纪新闻因有果，悦敦亲戚话无枝。\n空庭石立堪呼丈，漱揽云烟傍曲篱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52729,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次日同夏若时陪叶梅廊过集式谷堂即事","author":"张拙","text":"秋深夹路起凉烟，步入迁莺别有天。\n散诞形骸无俗韵，流连笑语得清缘。\n摘来篱豆供鲜荚，买到鲈鱼不问筌。\n一室羲皇真意在，萧骚霜鬓各忘年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52730,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵题深柳堂赠陈楼东","author":"张拙","text":"万轴缃芸绿野堂，幽禽争集远康庄。\n窗边流水穿欹枕，村外归云护短墙。\n密叶似含清露重，柔条疑带晚风长。\n渔樵或过抛书卷，小立柴门问雨旸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52731,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙未中秋无月","author":"张拙","text":"九夏全无雨，中秋独结云。\n阴晴终日变，明暗倏时分。\n胜地谁开宴，良朋自失群。\n飘摇金粟尽，把盏若为醺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52732,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶集芜园次韵二首 其一","author":"张拙","text":"为爱君家石上苔，抱琴时过两三回。\n秋花恋蝶风前舞，野鹤栖云竹外来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52733,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶集芜园次韵二首 其二","author":"张拙","text":"何处桃源堪问渡，此间蓬岛足衔杯。\n情深子建还相契，童稚开关总不猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52734,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次笪在辛韵","author":"张拙","text":"纳凉何处避尘埃，步入深林暑气回。\n尚有幽花随地放，何妨麋鹿隔溪来。\n风生两腋频尝茗，愁破千重数举杯。\n调合自能高百世，诗成还让建安才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52735,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次曹诵芬韵和沙定峰城南度夏元韵","author":"张拙","text":"天涯游倦返征车，爱僻来从茂草居。\n静对山光能悦鸟，閒临水色不惊鱼。\n清风有意来松径，皓月多情恋竹卢。\n咫尺相亲谁似我，饱看良友满床书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52736,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"点绛唇 暮景","author":"叶小鸾","text":"薄卷红绡，断霞西角斜阳远。\n昼长无伴。\n闲去题花扇。\n独倚阑干，看尽归鸦遍。\n轻云乱。\n凉风吹散。\n新月中天见。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52737,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"点绛唇 咏采莲女","author":"叶小鸾","text":"粉面新妆，澹红衫子轻罗扇。\n昨宵邻伴。\n来约莲塘玩。\n棹泛扁舟，影共莲花乱。\n深深见。\n绿杨风晚。\n空载闲愁返。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52738,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 春暮","author":"叶小鸾","text":"一瞬春光最可嗟。\n东风老去夕阳斜。\n断肠芳草遍天涯。\n粉蝶眠春随梦去，游丝系树带花赊。\n可知春思在谁家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52739,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 小窗即事","author":"叶小鸾","text":"竹径烟迷薜荔墙，好风摇曳弄垂杨。\n无情啼鸟向人忙。\n一曲瑶琴消午梦，半炉沉水爇春香。\n倚阑无语又斜阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52740,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 送春近作","author":"叶小鸾","text":"春色三分付流水。\n风风雨雨送花休。\n韶光原自不能留。\n梦里有山堪遁世，醒来无酒可浇愁。\n独怜闲处最难求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52741,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 同两姊戏赠母婢随春","author":"叶小鸾","text":"欲比飞花态更轻。\n低徊红颊背银屏。\n半娇斜倚似含情。\n嗔带澹霞笼白雪，语偷新燕怯黄莺。\n不胜力弱懒调筝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52742,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 书怀","author":"叶小鸾","text":"几欲呼天天更赊。\n自知山水此生遐。\n谁教生性是烟霞。\n屈指数来惊岁月，流光闲去厌繁华。\n何时骖鹤到仙家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52743,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 元宵无月","author":"叶小鸾","text":"画楼春弄东风软。\n灯山处处笙歌满。\n几点落梅花。\n侯家醉丽华。\n歌声还唤酒。\n夜色频催漏。\n云幕掩嫦娥。\n清光不放多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52744,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 春日","author":"叶小鸾","text":"轻烟一抹连天碧。\n帘前规月和烟白。\n翠竹落梅疏。\n相怜雪霁初。\n博山香欲烬。\n风透纱窗冷。\n四望寂寥寥。\n闲阶花影摇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52745,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 初秋","author":"叶小鸾","text":"池塘碧浸芙蓉面。\n莲房怨粉惊团扇。\n何处一声声。\n隔溪歌采菱。\n轻云流影急。\n秋入平芜色。\n寒雁几曾还。\n一江烟水寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52746,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 秋夜","author":"叶小鸾","text":"秋声又到梧桐井。\n半廊花雾笼虚影。\n试唤侍儿来。\n纱窗带月开。\n浮光怜露叶。\n暗草蛩凄切。\n何事独愁予。\n新词吟未如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52747,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"减字木兰花","author":"叶小鸾","text":"睡花蝴蝶。\n枕上梦魂轻似叶。\n几许秋声。\n恼乱琴心病茂陵。\n云横露霭。\n天外青山何处在。\n蕉雨潇潇。\n不管人愁只乱敲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52748,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜算子 秋思","author":"叶小鸾","text":"天澹水云平，风袅花枝动。\n罗幕凉生翠袖轻，柳外飞烟共。\n独座思悠扬，箫管慵拈弄。\n怅冷西窗一夜香，寂寞添幽梦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52749,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒金门 秋雨","author":"叶小鸾","text":"秋雨急。\n酿就晓寒相逼。\n竹箨凄迷芳径窄。\n一庭闲翠积。\n雁字无人寄得。\n落叶纷纷如摘。\n懒捻金针推指涩。\n绣床连夜湿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52750,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆秦娥 秋思","author":"叶小鸾","text":"湘钩揭。\n梧桐落向银床咽。\n银床咽。\n半庭斜日，数堆黄叶。\n绣屏一缕销香怯。\n花阑又见飞蝴蝶。\n飞蝴蝶。\n怪他轻薄，捣衣时节。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52751,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洛阳春 柳絮","author":"叶小鸾","text":"点点离魂如雨。\n轻狂随处。\n天涯不识旧章台，更阻断、游人路。\n蓦地送将春去。\n燕慵莺怃。\n飘飘闪闪去还来，拾取问、浑无语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52752,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阮郎归 秋思","author":"叶小鸾","text":"红绡秋锁小栏西。\n绿鬟鸾镜低。\n晓妆初罢思依依。\n徘徊花影移。\n沉水爇，绮栊垂。\n闲愁不上眉。\n鸳鸯新绣裌罗衣。\n初寒半暖时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52753,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阮郎归 秋夜","author":"叶小鸾","text":"风飘黄叶怆辞枝。\n楼前处处飞。\n闲来无闷亦凄其。\n方知秋气悲。\n堪叹处，可怜时。\n倚栏空自知。\n徘徊魂梦欲何依。\n沉吟黯黯思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52754,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"虞美人影 春日","author":"叶小鸾","text":"海棠睡惹流莺恼。\n又是清明过了。\n杨柳水边多少。\n愁绪萦芳草。\n杜鹃枝上东风悄。\n碧玉栏前人杳。\n一夜绿娇红老。\n只恐春归早。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52755,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]